     ],
     "reviewBody": "Recieved my protein coffee yesterday and tried it out this morning. I got the sweet cream and it is DELICIOUS! I just mixed it with plain water and it was rich and creamy. Nice to have another easy protein boost first thing in the morning before the gym. Definitely recommend!",
