     },
     "datePublished": "2026-06-27T16:04:30Z",
     "image": [
      "https://review-images.judgeme.com/transparent-labs/1782576270__img_4503__original.jpeg?quality=80&width=1024"
     ],
     "reviewBody": "For someone who doesn\u2019t like coffee but trying to get away from energy drinks, protein coffee mocha is delish! Not a strong coffee taste in my opinion, and when adding 8oz of Fairlife Ultra-filtered nonfat milk, it makes it have a smooth and creamy rich taste! I just hope that they keep it in stock for the subscribers!",
