      "name": "Windy Z."
     },
     "datePublished": "2026-05-17T11:26:49Z",
     "image": [
      "https://review-images.judgeme.com/transparent-labs/1779017210__1854__original.jpg?quality=80&width=1024"
     ],
     "reviewBody": "The two flavors I have tried have been amazing. It has a good coffee flavor and enough caffeine to get me going. I have started using this pre-workout as well.",
     "reviewRating": {
      "@type": "Rating",
      "bestRating": 5,
