    {
     "@type": "Review",
     "author": {
      "@type": "Person",
      "name": "Shalee P."
     },
     "datePublished": "2026-05-05T16:19:37Z",
     "image": [
      "https://review-images.judgeme.com/transparent-labs/1777997978__image__original.jpg?quality=80&width=1024"
     ],
     "reviewBody": "Better than my usual morning coffee! I recently started looking for better options for my morning coffee after I realized how many calories I was consuming in coffee creamer daily, but was unwilling to give up coffee all together. My doctor recommended the Transparent Labs brand to me, and behold, they have protein coffee in my beloved sweet cream flavor. I was skeptical, as whey protein typically has a taste I cannot stand. Imagine my shock when I took the first sip of this protein coffee and it was actually GOOD. Like delicious, without the nasty Whey protein after taste I am used to from protein loaded foods. It also dissolves insanely well and leaves behind no grainy residue. I look forward to drinking this coffee every morning AND I\u2019m not consuming an insane amount of calories in creamer. Overall, a win! I couldn\u2019t be happier with this product and will be repurchasing!",
     "reviewRating": {
      "@type": "Rating",
      "bestRating": 5,
      "ratingValue": 5,
      "worstRating": 1
