     "datePublished": "2026-09-23T01:07:07Z",
     "reviewBody": "Latte flavor is the most similar to actual coffee/cold brew. I added some caramel sauce to mine to make it a caramel latte. It was delicious, smooth, not gritty, and didn\u2019t make me \u201con edge\u201d like regular coffee does\u2026 maybe it\u2019s because there\u2019s protien in it? I will say, after you mix it, the vitamin/supplement smell DOES NOT reflect the taste. It\u2019s odd because you think you\u2019d be tasting that supplemental chalk but it really does taste like a mom n pop coffee shop brewed coffee. After a few sips, it was pretty good. I\u2019d buy this flavor again. It\u2019s smooth and a great base to add flavor/sauces too if you like flavored coffee",
